WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.920
- But isn't it true that Queen
Latifah kind of inspired you

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.510
to start recording?

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:08.232
- Well, Queen Latifah,
at a club called Nell's,

00:00:08.232 --> 00:00:10.730
this was actually goes further back.

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:11.563
- Oh, wow.

00:00:11.563 --> 00:00:13.330
- Is like when I was a bouncer in New York

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.187
anytime I saw a musician, I said,

00:00:15.187 --> 00:00:18.940
"I could rap, I have raps,
I have flow, I have bars."

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:20.350
And she said, "Do something."

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:22.630
And I did this kind of guttural sound

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:24.560
that would later become Groot.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.050
And she said, "Can you carry
that through a whole song?"

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:30.440
Later in life, about six years ago,

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.347
I was at an Oscar party and she said,

00:00:33.347 --> 00:00:35.700
"I would buy a CD of you mumbling."

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.620
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.280
And by the way, you mentioned
it, so I'll talk about it.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.411
Groot's my favorite character.

00:00:41.411 --> 00:00:42.244
(Vin Diesel applauding)

00:00:42.244 --> 00:00:45.770
And it's my mother and I's,
we separately found this out.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:47.020
'Cause I was like, she had a little Groot

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:47.853
and I was like, "Is that your fave,

00:00:47.853 --> 00:00:48.690
"that's my favorite one."

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:49.523
- [Vin Diesel] That's awesome.

00:00:49.523 --> 00:00:50.560
- [Kelly] Yeah, you're
out favorite, just saying.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.393
- Oh thank you.

00:00:51.393 --> 00:00:52.531
- [Kelly] I'm a huge fan of
"Guardians of the Galaxy"

00:00:52.531 --> 00:00:54.803
You win.
- Oh, thank you.

